Ego2Robot Open Reproduction
Copyright 2026 Liu Yanming (@aownown)

This repository is an independent engineering reproduction inspired by
"Ego2Robot: Scalable Robot Data Synthesis from Egocentric Human Data"
(arXiv:2608.02580). It is not the official implementation.

The repository contains original orchestration, adapters, checks, and
documentation. Upstream model source, weights, datasets, and render assets are
fetched separately from their official providers and remain governed by their
own licenses. See THIRD_PARTY.md for citations and distribution boundaries.
